#
#
#  O. Long / UCSB
#
#      $Id: ADS-d0pi-kpi-dcs.dec,v 1.1.1.1 2005/03/29 17:12:11 steinke Exp $
#
#
Alias MyB+         B+
Alias MyB-         B-
Alias MyD0         D0
Alias Myanti-D0    anti-D0
#
Decay Upsilon(4S)
0.5 MyB+  B-          VSS;
0.5 MyB-  B+          VSS;
Enddecay
#
#
Decay MyB-
1.0    pi- MyD0       PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay MyB+
1.0    pi+ Myanti-D0  PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay MyD0
1.0    K+  pi-        PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay Myanti-D0
1.0    K-  pi+        PHSP;
Enddecay
#
#
End
